        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of panels of silk damask, France, ca. 1700-1705."@en , "Pair of woven silk panels, pale blue damask ground brocaded in salmon pink silk, silver and gold thread with a bizarre design - exotic fruit on a vaguely palm-like stem form and a similar stem with umbrellas. The damask sub-pattern contains complementary motifs."@en ;
